Z||000000||BOILERMAKER||06-29-2000||09:28 PM||||OK, really my dad did the shooting, but I did all of the body work.<P>Before<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1A.jpg"> <P>Still before (does anybody see a 3-tone Fiero?)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2A.jpg"> <P>Right after the shooting.  This one makes me drool. (Uh, sorry guys while I wipe my chin)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3A.jpg"> <P>Well here is Frankenfiero in her finest.  Gosh I'm glad I did that.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/4A.jpg"> <P>Now only 3 more weeks until I can actually wash her with real soap!!!!  I can't wait.||||reg||11
