Z||000008||dogtired||06-30-2000||05:51 AM||||GREAT LOOKING CAR  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Ill bet the rest of the Forum, including myself would like to see a detailed write up on how it came to be??<BR>I am thinking, Fillers, Flex agents, Wet sand, dry sand, type of primer. Brand names of stuff used Paint, etc?? Clear coat prep? Prep between coats??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> What all did you remove from the body, paint any parts off the car??<BR>Just a few of the questions I have when thinking of painting a car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I have only painted metal body cars and think it would be almost the same BUT there can be small differences that really effect the final result??<BR>Just some thoughts?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>THAT IS A GREAT LOOKING CAR!||||reg||6
