Z||000012||fropuff||06-30-2000||09:34 AM||||That looks the BEST!  I also like the new black ground effects.  You should enter a show.  Would win every time!  Did it take a lot of prep work like mine is?  I don't care though, because all the work you put into it will be part of the end result.  I don't know if I'm a retard, but what does D.A. mean?  For the front fascia on mine, I'm using a plastic chemical stripper.  The fascia is really bad.  Cracks all over.  I just hope mine will turn out half as good as yours.  Did you re-primer or did you just sand off the shine and down to the primer?  Very nice.||||reg||10
